@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Activity: guarded work and post-commit fork/join
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

start
:Validate explicit intent;
if (Valid?) then (yes)
 :Enter bounded coordination / transaction;
 :Check current authority, lifecycle and identity;
 if (New eligible intent with expected version?) then (yes)
  :Build exact snapshot;
  :Coherently commit revision, pointer and result;
  fork
   :Map permitted caller result;
  fork again
   :Record bounded non-authoritative diagnostics;
  end fork
  :End scenario observation;
 else (no)
  :Return permitted recorded result or safe refusal;
 endif
else (no)
 :Return safe invalid result;
endif
stop

@enduml
